<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>GLM大模型测评</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {  }
        body { 
            background-color: var(--bg-color, #f9fafb); 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            display: flex; justify-content: center;
        }
        .font-serif { font-family: 'Caveat', serif; }
        [data-comp-id]:hover { outline: 2px dashed #ff2442; outline-offset: -2px; cursor: pointer; }
        .mobile-viewport {
            width: 100%; max-width: 420px;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            padding: 24px 16px 80px 16px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="mobile-viewport">
        <div id="collage_glm_1" data-comp-id="collage_glm_1" class="relative w-full py-8 px-4 flex flex-col items-center "><div class="w-full transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:z-30 -rotate-1 mb-4" style="z-index: 10">
        <div id="polaroid_glm_1" data-comp-id="polaroid_glm_1" class="bg-white p-3 pb-10 shadow-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col gap-3 group ">
            <div class="aspect-square bg-gray-50 overflow-hidden relative">
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/xhs/800/800" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-transparent via-white/5 to-white/10 pointer-events-none"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center font-serif italic text-stone-500 text-sm tracking-wide">Moment in 2026</div>
        </div>
        </div><div class="w-full transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:z-30 rotate-1 mb-4" style="z-index: 11">
        <div id="handwritten_mood_1" data-comp-id="handwritten_mood_1" class="p-4 transform -rotate-1 ">
            <div class="relative inline-block">
                <div class="absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-full h-3 bg-rose-100/40 -z-10 rounded-full"></div>
                <p class="text-stone-700 font-serif italic text-[16px] leading-relaxed">"博主的碎碎念..."</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div><div class="w-full transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:z-30 -rotate-2 mb-4" style="z-index: 12"><div id="story_glm_1" data-comp-id="story_glm_1" class="px-2 "><p class="mb-3 text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">最近体验了一把GLM大模型，简直颠覆了我对AI的认知！不管是文本生成还是数据处理，它都能做到快速、精准！</p><p class="mb-3 text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">GLM在数据处理方面的速度真是令人惊叹，几乎没有等待的时间，快速响应让我在工作中大大提高了效率。</p><p class="mb-3 text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">就拿我平时的工作需求来说，GLM不仅能生成高质量的文本，还能理解复杂的指令，真的是太智能了！每次使用都能让我感受到AI的魅力。</p><p class="mb-3 text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">总的来说，GLM大模型是一个值得尝试的强大工具，尤其适合需要高效数据处理的朋友们！快来体验一下吧！</p></div></div><div class="w-full transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:z-30 rotate-2 mb-4" style="z-index: 13">
        <div id="handwritten_mood_2" data-comp-id="handwritten_mood_2" class="p-4 transform -rotate-1 ">
            <div class="relative inline-block">
                <div class="absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-full h-3 bg-rose-100/40 -z-10 rounded-full"></div>
                <p class="text-stone-700 font-serif italic text-[16px] leading-relaxed">"博主的碎碎念..."</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div><div class="w-full transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:z-30 -rotate-1 mb-4" style="z-index: 14">
        <div id="polaroid_glm_2" data-comp-id="polaroid_glm_2" class="bg-white p-3 pb-10 shadow-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col gap-3 group ">
            <div class="aspect-square bg-gray-50 overflow-hidden relative">
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/xhs/800/800" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-transparent via-white/5 to-white/10 pointer-events-none"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center font-serif italic text-stone-500 text-sm tracking-wide">Moment in 2026</div>
        </div>
        </div><div class="w-full transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:z-30 rotate-1 mb-4" style="z-index: 15">
        <div id="handwritten_mood_3" data-comp-id="handwritten_mood_3" class="p-4 transform -rotate-1 ">
            <div class="relative inline-block">
                <div class="absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-full h-3 bg-rose-100/40 -z-10 rounded-full"></div>
                <p class="text-stone-700 font-serif italic text-[16px] leading-relaxed">"博主的碎碎念..."</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div><div class="w-full transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:z-30 -rotate-2 mb-4" style="z-index: 16">
        <div id="interactions_glm_1" data-comp-id="interactions_glm_1" class="flex items-center justify-between py-4 border-t border-gray-50 ">
            <div class="flex gap-6 text-gray-400">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span>🤍</span><span class="text-xs font-bold">0</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span>⭐</span><span class="text-xs font-bold">0</span></div>
            </div>
            <button class="px-6 py-2 bg-[#ff2442] text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-red-500/20 active:scale-95 transition-all">关注博主</button>
        </div>
        </div></div>
    </div>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('click', e => {
            const comp = e.target.closest('[data-comp-id]');
            if (comp) window.parent.postMessage({ type: 'SELECT_REGION', id: comp.dataset.compId }, '*');
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
